I wanted to extend a congratulations to the 9 Nazgul in Spork! They
have officially made it onto my list of likely genocide targets!

Truly though, I do like their new ability, although it can be rather
debilitating on the Astral Plane!  Fortunately they can't scream all
the way across a level.  Since it can be rather dangerous to switch
out one's standard armor for yellow DSM, how about being able to (P)ut
on tallow or wax candles to stuff one's ears?  The downside (albeit
slight) would be that all sounds would be turned off (e.g. 'noises in
the distance', 'splashing of a naiad', etc.).  I suppose also, to
balance out the positive aspect of having stuffed ears would be that
with a successful hit a monster might knock the wax out of the hero's
ears.  And of course putting the candle in one's ears would fully
consume the candle.

Without this I might have to go back to collecting Nazgul trophies
(i.e. cursed ring of invisibility named #9) just to know that I killed
them all before they teamed up with the Riders.

